fullscreen app like evolution, it displays instantly.  Going back and forth
between desktops that have epiphany and evolution also is good.  But if I
switch to an empty desktop, nouveau takes about one second to repaint the
desktop icons and text (wallpaper appears instantly).  Neither the nv nor
nvidia drivers have this issue.


